er every closed-environment claim across all seven artifact texts and the three documentation pages names the platform it was exercised on — including headlines, summaries and passing mentions, not only the places where the claim is argued. Do not merge.","head":"5a4ee9e9ba1d13fd5c1953b3db860ec041b35744","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}